The workflow above uses **only the built‑in blocks** (`starter`, `api`, `loop`, `function`, `response`). No custom libraries are required, so it runs immediately on Sim’s runtime. Feel free to adjust any string or numeric value (e.g., time zone, request timeout) to fit your production needs.

